From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tinycast Recipe <recipe@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:45:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] tinycast-space 0026: update check errors
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A failed *Check for Updates* reports the check and its cause — offline or another URL error, GitHub's rate limit (429, or 403 with `X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0` / `Retry-After`), or the HTTP status — instead of a failed download (`UpdateFailure.checkFailed`, `check()` throws); a check already running says so. The message half of [mSarheed/pipcast](https://github.com/mSarheed/pipcast/commit/0fee6712).

Origin: tinycast-space 0026-update-check-errors.patch @ ffccfc3
---
